---
import { Button, Collapse, Spoiler, Timeline } from 'astro-pure/user'
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'
import Substats from '@/components/about/Substats.astro'
import ToolSection from '@/components/about/ToolSection.astro'

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'hobbies', text: 'Hobbies' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'tools', text: 'Tools' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'social-networks', text: 'Social Networks' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'gossips', text: 'Gossips' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'about-blog', text: 'About Blog' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='About' {headings} comment>
  <p>PhD Student / AI Researcher</p>
  <p>
    Hi there.<br /> I'm Yuishin, a PhD student at Chinese Information Processing Laboratory (CIPL), the
    Institute of Software, Chinese Academy of Sciences (ISCAS) <br /> B.S. in Computer Science and Technology
    (Brain Science and Artificial Intelligence), Nanjing University.
  </p>
  <p>Research Interests: Agent Architecture & AI Infrastructure.</p>
  <p>INTJ-A</p>
  <p>
    Motto: My compass is curiosity.
    <blockquote>
      Wenn wir den Stand gewählt, in dem wir am meisten für die Menschheit wirken können, dann
      können uns Lasten nicht niederbeugen, weil sie nur Opfer für alle sind; dann genießen wir
      keine arme, eingeschränkte, egoistische Freude, sondern unser Glück gehört Millionen, unsere
      Taten leben still, aber ewig wirkend fort, und unsere Asche wird benetzt von der glühenden
      Träne edler Menschen.
    </blockquote>
  </p>

  {/* general-talk */}
  <h2 id='hobbies'>Hobbies</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Gaming, especially puzzle | factory automation | non-competitive co-op | rhythm games (Notable
      favorites: Minecraft, Outer Wilds)
    </li>
    <li>Light novels, manga, vocaloids and anime</li>
    <li>Badminton (recreational level)</li>
  </ul>

  {/* tools */}
  <h2 id='tools'>Tools</h2>
  <p>The following tools are part of my research and daily workflow:</p>
  <ToolSection
    class='mb-5'
    title='Design'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'Photoshop',
        description: 'Picture Editing',
        href: 'https://www.adobe.com/products/photoshop',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/photoshop.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Illustrator',
        description: 'Vector Drawing',
        href: 'https://www.adobe.com/products/illustrator',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/illustrator.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Premiere Pro',
        description: 'Video Editing',
        href: 'https://www.adobe.com/products/premiere',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/premiere.svg?raw')
      }
    ]}
  />
  <ToolSection
    class='mb-5'
    title='Productivity'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'Obsidian',
        description: 'Knowledge Management',
        href: 'https://obsidian.md/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/obsidian.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'GoodNotes',
        description: 'Note Taking',
        href: 'https://www.goodnotes.com/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/goodnotes.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'OBS Studio',
        description: 'Screen Recording',
        href: 'https://obsproject.com/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/obs-studio.svg?raw')
      }
    ]}
  />
  <ToolSection
    class='mb-5'
    title='Development'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'VS Code',
        description: 'IDE',
        href: 'https://code.visualstudio.com/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/vscode.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'CodeX',
        description: 'AI Coding Assistant',
        href: 'https://openai.com/codex/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/codex.svg?raw')
      }
    ]}
  />
  <ToolSection
    class='mb-5'
    title='Environment'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'Windows 11',
        description: 'ROG Zephyrus G15',
        href: 'https://news.microsoft.com/windows11-general-availability/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/windows11.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'MacOS 27',
        description: 'MacBook Air',
        href: 'https://www.apple.com/macos/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/apple.svg?raw')
      }
    ]}
  />

  {/* social-networks */}
  <h2 id='social-networks'>Social Networks</h2>
  <p>You can find me on the following platforms:</p>
  <Substats
    stats={[
      {
        platform: 'GitHub',
        icon: 'github',
        link: 'https://github.com/24Kgule',
        text: 'followers',
        api: 'github/24Kgule'
      },
      {
        platform: 'Steam',
        icon: 'steam',
        color: '#50769d',
        link: 'https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198332315987/',
        text: 'games',
        api: 'steamgames/76561198332315987'
      }
    ]}
  />

  {/* gossips */}
  <h2 id='gossips'>Gossips</h2>
  <Collapse title='山月記'>
    我深怕自己本非美玉，故而不敢加以刻苦琢磨，却又半信自己是块美玉，故又不肯庸庸碌碌，与瓦砾为伍。于是我渐渐地脱离凡尘，疏远世人，结果便是一任愤懑与羞恨日益助长内心那怯弱的自尊心。其实，任何人都是驯兽师，而那野兽，无非就是各人的性情而已。
    于我而言，这种妄自尊大的羞耻心就是野兽，就是猛虎。它毁了我自己，害苦了我的妻儿，伤害了我的友人，最后，又如此这般，将我的外形也变成了与内心相一致的模样。
    如今想来，我自己仅有的那么一点才华也都付诸东流了。
    我常卖弄什么“无所作为，则人生太长；欲有所为，则人生太短”的格言，其实我哪有什么远大的志向，无非是害怕暴露自己才华不足之卑劣的恐惧和不肯刻苦用功的无耻之怠惰而已。
  </Collapse>

  {/* about-blog */}
  <h2 id='about-blog'>About Blog</h2>
  <p>Website history:</p>
  <Timeline
    events={[
      {
        date: '2026-07',
        content: 'Began exploring frameworks and templates for my personal website'
      },
      {
        date: '2026-08',
        content: 'Construction completed'
      }
    ]}
  />
  <p>
    The smooth operation and personalized customization of website also rely on the resources and
    technical support provided by the following excellent projects/service providers:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Domain: <a href='https://github.io' target='_blank'>Github.io</a></li>
    <li>
      Framework & Theme: <a href='https://astro.build/' target='_blank'>Astro</a> + <a
        href='https://github.com/cworld1/astro-theme-pure'
        target='_blank'>Astro Theme Pure</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      Site hosting: <a href='https://docs.github.com/en/pages' target='_blank'>Github Pages</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      CI/CD: <a href='https://github.com/features/actions' target='_blank'>Github Actions</a>
    </li>
    <li>Comment system: <a href='https://waline.js.org' target='_blank'>Waline</a></li>
    <li>
      Visits: <a href='https://supabase.com/' target='_blank'>Supabase</a> +
      <a href='https://waline.js.org/' target='_blank'>Waline</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      Other statistics: <a href='https://github.com/spencerwooo/substats' target='_blank'
        >Substats</a
      >
    </li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
